er \nstated that FICC accepts additional securities for clearing fund \ndeposits", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "positive", "rubric_matches": [8, 37], "_snap_kind": "ws_normalized"}, {"signal_text": "including eligible obligations of U.S. agencies or government \nsponsored entities and eligible mortgage-backed securities", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "positive", "rubric_matches": [37, 70], "_snap_kind": "ws_normalized"}], "_snap_kind": "ws_normalized"}, {"passage_text": "The commenter also stated that the Commission found--in the context of approving a FICC rule change--that the expanded scope of acceptable forms of clearing fund collateral deposits would \"better enable FICC to assure the safeguarding of securities and funds in its custody or control or for which it is responsible,\" and therefore was consistent with the requirements of the Exchange Act and other governing regulations.", "passage_polarity": "positive", "signals": [{"signal_text": "the Commission found--in the context of approving a FICC rule change--that the expanded scope of acceptable forms of clearing fund collateral deposits would \"better enable FICC to assure the safeguarding of securities and funds in its custody or control or for which it is responsible\"", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "positive", "rubric_matches": [7, 33], "_snap_kind": "anchor_only"}, {"signal_text": "therefore was consistent with the requirements of the Exchange Act and other governing regulations", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "positive", "rubric_matches": [41, 191], "_snap_kind": "exact"}], "_snap_kind": "anchor_only"}, {"passage_text": "The term \"qualified customer securities\" is defined to mean securities of a customer of the broker-dealer (other than U.S. Treasury securities) that are held in custody by the broker-dealer for the customer and that under the rules of the U.S. Treasury securities CCA are eligible to be used to margin U.S. Treasury securities positions of the customer that are cleared, settled, and novated by the CCA.", "passage_polarity": "positive", "signals": [{"signal_text": "The term \"qualified customer securities\" is defined to mean securities of a customer of the broker-dealer", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "positive", "rubric_matches": [97, 44], "_snap_kind": "exact"}, {"signal_text": "that under the rules of the U.S. Treasury securities CCA are eligible to be used to margin U.S. Treasury securities positions of the customer", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "positive", "rubric_matches": [44, 117], "_snap_kind": "exact"}], "_snap_kind": "no_match"}]}, "raw_text": "{\"unit_id\": \"SEC-2024-0041-0001\", \"passages\": [{\"passage_text\": \"The Commission did not receive any comments on this aspect of the proposal and is adopting it substantially as proposed.\", \"passage_polarity\": \"neutral\", \"signals\": [{\"signal_text\": \"The Commission did not receive any comments on this aspect of the proposal\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"neutral\", \"rubric_matches\": [23, 36]}, {\"signal_text\": \"is adopting it substantially as proposed\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"neutral\", \"rubric_matches\": [21, 129]}]}, {\"passage_text\": \"The Commission did not receive any comments on these aspects of the proposal and is adopting them as proposed.\", \"passage_polarity\": \"neutral\", \"signals\": [{\"signal_text\": \"The Commission did not receive any comments on these aspects of the proposal\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"neutral\", \"rubric_matches\": [23, 36]}, {\"signal_text\": \"is adopting them as proposed\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"neutral\", \"rubric_matches\": [21, 129]}]}, {\"passage_text\": \"In response to comments, the Commission is modifying paragraph (a) of Note H to permit \\\"qualified customer securities\\\" to be used to meet the customer position margin requirement in addition to